{"response":{"result":1,"resultcount":1,"publishedfiledetails":[{"publishedfileid":"3798404599","result":1,"creator":"76561198273714027","creator_app_id":1158310,"consumer_app_id":1158310,"filename":"","file_size":"999430","file_url":"","hcontent_file":"1652585932449829088","preview_url":"https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/12259841076209923331/3FBA68D2219FB4F97177980308C8FB6A7F5987DF/","hcontent_preview":"12259841076209923331","title":"Reclaim the Motherland — 重整河山","description":"[h1]Reclaim the Motherland / 重整河山[/h1]\n[b]天命可以失去，王朝不必随之湮灭。 / Lose the Mandate, not the dynasty.[/b]\n0.4.2 · 适配目标 / Target: CK3 1.21.0.3 Florin · 需要《溥天之下》 / Requires All Under Heaven\n\n[h1]规则与开始方式 / Rules and play[/h1]\n开局选择【中华霸权统治者的命运】：默认【重整河山】保留旧朝，或选【群雄割据（原版）】走原版路径。【尊王诸侯的抉择】独立选择：默认【人心离散】，或【誓死尊王】使合资格尊王直属诸侯全部留朝。正常游玩至群雄割据，无需控制台。\nChoose Fate of the Chinese Hegemon: Reclaim the Motherland (default) or Vanilla Shattering. Separately choose Divided Hearts (default) or Unwavering Loyalty, which keeps every eligible Pro-Hegemon direct vassal. Play normally until vanilla Chaos; no console command is needed.\n\n[h1]后朝与忠臣 / The Later dynasty and loyalists[/h1]\n旧天子只失去中华霸权，保留个人领地、其他头衔及最终忠臣，建立空法理的【后＋原朝号】霸权。新朝号保留旧朝颜色、纹章与首都显示；89个标准朝号和自定义国号均保留创建时的名称，不随新天子改名。\nThe fallen emperor keeps personal lands, other titles and loyalists, receiving an empty-de-jure Later Hegemony. It retains the old colors, arms and displayed capital. All 89 standard dynasty names and custom names are frozen at creation.\n\n【人心离散】只结算裂解前有地、伯爵及以上的尊王直属诸侯，一次决定去留。对旧君作战、仇敌、家族世仇、不忠、极低好感或反旧君派系等公开决裂优先于亲密关系；挚友、灵魂伴侣、忠诚同宗及强牵制等可保留忠臣。其余按好感、性情、地位、军力、合法性与威慑计算：AI只掷一次；玩家诸侯用同一分数，50分及以上留朝，不弹出多人选择。\nDivided Hearts resolves landed, count-or-higher Pro-Hegemon direct lords once. Open war, rivalry, feud, disloyalty, extreme dislike or hostile factions override personal bonds. Close ties, loyal kin and strong hooks can secure loyalty. Other cases weigh opinion, personality, rank, strength, legitimacy and dread. AI rolls once; human vassals use the same score with a deterministic 50-point cutoff, without a multiplayer choice prompt.\n\n留朝者保留原头衔、国号、直属关系与整棵下级封臣树，不被弱小AI势力清理或改名；叛离者及其他直属诸侯按原版割据逻辑重组，间接封臣不越级投靠，男爵随合法伯爵领主。\nLoyalists keep titles, names, direct allegiance and vassal trees, avoiding weak-AI pruning and renaming. Defectors and other direct lords follow vanilla Chaos reorganization; indirect vassals stay with their lieges; barons follow county rulers.\n\n玩家旧君以【人心向背】事件查看去留摘要。 / The player emperor receives a summary of loyalties and defections.\n\n[h1]继承与九部 / Succession and ministries[/h1]\n后朝以单一继承法跟随引擎主继承人；旧君死亡后接续同一后朝头衔、忠臣领国和合资格旧官，不重造新朝。其他个人头衔照常继承。既有带标记后朝在载入时幂等补齐继承设置，不重置持有人、国号、纹章或复辟进度。\nThe Later title uses single-heir succession and follows the engine-selected primary heir, preserving the same title, loyalist realms and eligible incumbents after death. Other personal titles follow normal succession. Marked Later titles gain load migration without resetting holder, name, arms or restoration progress.\n\n中华霸权空缺时，仅最近失去天命、以后朝为主头衔且符合原版天朝政体与预算条件的统治者享有三省六部九席资格。合资格留朝旧臣原位保留，叛离者离任，真实空缺由原版任免；新一轮后朝取代旧朝的唯一资格。不会因此保留天命、中书门下权力分享、稳定阶段或现任中华霸权专属特权。\nWhile China is vacant, only the latest fallen dynasty with a primary Later title and vanilla Celestial/budget eligibility retains the nine ministries. Eligible loyal incumbents stay, defectors leave and vanilla appointments fill vacancies. Newer Later dynasties supersede this entitlement. It grants no Mandate, Grand Secretariat power-sharing, Stability or reigning-Hegemony privileges.\n\n[h1]外交与复辟 / Diplomacy and restoration[/h1]\n后朝仍是霸权级，但不冒领现任中华霸权的附庸身份优惠：品级差超过一级时仅保留普通固定+10，并恢复高阶拒绝条件，其他原版接受度理由照常。本轮实际脱离的直属诸侯对确切后朝获得1825日【新近自立】-50，双方换君不能绕过；这是软性阻力，仍可凭其他优势说服，期满正常外交。忠臣、无关独立者和没有实际释放记录的旧档不补标。\nLater rulers keep hegemony rank without reigning-China vassalization perks: gaps above one tier retain ordinary +10, high-tier refusals return, and other vanilla reasons remain. Direct lords actually released by this collapse gain Recently Independent (-50) against that exact Later dynasty for 1,825 days. Ruler changes cannot bypass it; good diplomacy may still succeed. Loyalists, unrelated rulers and old saves lacking release records are not marked.\n\n后朝持有者不能【宣称天命】；群雄割据期间，独立、成年且和平，并控制中华法理伯爵领51%（50%不足，含合资格朝贡国领地）时，可在决议中【宣称复辟】。使用原版天命效果，随后销毁复辟者持有的全部后朝头衔，其他人的后朝不受影响。别人夺得天命不会自动摧毁你的后朝，仍可等待下一轮割据；多代后朝可以并存。玩家与AI均受适用资格限制。\nA Later ruler cannot Claim the Mandate. During Chaos, an independent adult at peace controlling 51% of China's de-jure counties (50% is insufficient; qualifying tributaries count) can Proclaim the Restoration through Decisions. Vanilla Mandate effects run, then all of that ruler's Later titles end; other rulers' Later titles remain. Another ruler gaining the Mandate does not erase your Later dynasty, which may await later Chaos. Eligible AI rulers can also restore.\n\n[h1]兼容与语言 / Compatibility and languages[/h1]\n推荐新开单人档；不保证跨游戏大版本存档兼容。割据、天命决议、官署准入和提议附庸同类修改可能有加载顺序冲突。原版割据事件的部分提示仍用原版措辞，请结合所选规则、后朝与新决议查看结果。\nNew single-player games are recommended; cross-major-version save compatibility is not guaranteed. Mods changing Chaos shattering, Mandate decisions, ministry access or Offer Vassalization may conflict by load order. Some Chaos tooltips keep vanilla wording; check the rules, Later title and restoration decision.\nEnglish / 简体中文 / Français / Deutsch / 日本語 / 한국어 / Polski / Русский / Español\n\n[h1]历史画面 / Historical images[/h1]\n0.4.0 · CK3 1.19.0.6\n[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/83c00de8ed6eeabb2eb234768fd781cb4f7acd11/workshop/reclaim_the_motherland_media/00_divided_hearts_live.jpg[/img]\n[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/83c00de8ed6eeabb2eb234768fd781cb4f7acd11/workshop/reclaim_the_motherland_media/01_later_dynasty_live.jpg[/img]\n[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/83c00de8ed6eeabb2eb234768fd781cb4f7acd11/workshop/reclaim_the_motherland_media/02_restoration_decision_live.jpg[/img]\n[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence/83c00de8ed6eeabb2eb234768fd781cb4f7acd11/workshop/reclaim_the_motherland_media/03_restoration_confirm_live.jpg[/img]\n\n[h1]源码 / Source[/h1]\nhttps://github.com/XenoAmess/ck3_eternal_recurrence\n","time_created":1788929910,"time_updated":1795491643,"visibility":0,"banned":0,"ban_reason":"","subscriptions":79,"favorited":11,"lifetime_subscriptions":113,"lifetime_favorited":12,"views":932,"tags":[{"tag":"Gameplay"},{"tag":"1.21 'Florin'"}]}]}}